Package: viaunix-vpn
Version: 1.2.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: brunogmenezes <brunogmenezes@hotmail.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: openvpn, systemd, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, sudo
Description: VPN OpenVPN corporativa do ViaUnix (tela de login GDM + desktop)
 Conecta a VPN OpenVPN tanto antes do login (barra flutuante na tela do GDM)
 quanto automaticamente no login/desbloqueio (via viaunix-auth) e no menu do GNOME,
 mantendo o tunel ativo com a estacao bloqueada via openvpn-client@viaunix.
